## Laufzeitzustand

Empfohlener Hostpfad:

```text
/srv/merchfactory/deployments/{{SERVICE_NAME}}/
├── release.env
├── state.json
└── .deployment.lock
```

`release.env` enthält ausschließlich den aktuell freigegebenen Image-Digest. `state.json` enthält keine Secrets.

## Start / aktueller Zustand

Für verwaltete Deployments wird der gespeicherte Releasezustand verwendet:

```bash
docker compose \
  --env-file /srv/merchfactory/deployments/{{SERVICE_NAME}}/release.env \
  -p {{SERVICE_NAME}} \
  -f deployment/compose.yaml \
  up -d
```

Status:

```bash
python3 deployment/service-release.py status \
  --state-file /srv/merchfactory/deployments/{{SERVICE_NAME}}/state.json
```

Containerstatus:

```bash
docker compose \
  --env-file /srv/merchfactory/deployments/{{SERVICE_NAME}}/release.env \
  -p {{SERVICE_NAME}} \
  -f deployment/compose.yaml \
  ps
```

